# Cross-origin isolation — required for SharedArrayBuffer (WebLLM, ffmpeg.wasm).
# Mirrors vercel.json and the vite dev/preview middleware. Served by Cloudflare
# Workers static assets (the apps/server Worker) for every asset and the SPA shell.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: cross-origin
